  "review_notes": [
    "`הַשְּׁאֵרִית` → *them that had escaped*: the present article takes the supplied *them that* under rule 41 and the noun takes the recast verb under rule 46. The competing reading gives the whole phrase to the noun and marks the article `unrepresented`.",
    "The second `לְ` of `לוֹ וּלְבָנָיו` is `unrepresented` because the ASV writes one *to* for both members (rule 22)."
  ]
